{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00359","headline":"丹景山至德寺 · 蜀太后徐氏","name":"丹景山至德寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周回云水游丹景，因与真妃眺上方。\n晴日晓升金晃曜，寒泉夜落玉丁当。\n松梢月转琴栖影，柏径风牵麝食香。\n虔煠六铢宜铸祝，惟祈圣祉保遐昌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太后徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}